        <sp who="#wc">
          <speaker>Clark</speaker>
          <p>Set out early. Passed the mouth of Bear creek 25 yds wide at 6 Miles.</p>
          <p>The river rises fast. Course N 54 W 2 miles to a point Lb Side.</p>
        </sp>
